# Move the drone's own camera in the body frame.
#
# `pitch` is the one that matters and the one that has cost the most time: at -28.6 deg,
# level flight sits in the top 13.7% of the frame, so a backend that does not know the goal
# ALTITUDE will fly itself into the ground. Changing it invalidates comparisons against
# every episode scored at the old value - it is a measurement surface, not a preference.
float64[3] xyz                  # metres, body FRD, from the vehicle origin
float64 roll                    # degrees
float64 pitch
float64 yaw
---
bool success
string message
